<title>NORWAY: Norway August trade surplus rises to NOK 9.49 bln.</title>
<headline>Norway August trade surplus rises to NOK 9.49 bln.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator. Figures (billions of crowns, excludes ships and oil platforms)</p>
<p>NORWAY'S FOREIGN TRADE	AUG 1996   JULY 1996    AUG 1995</p>
<p>Imports			   16.17	 17.23	 17.14</p>
<p>Exports			   25.66	 23.30	 20.50</p>
<p>Balance			    9.49	  6.08	  3.36</p>
<p>Excluding oil/gas	     -3.85	 -5.62	 -5.40</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
